      "text": "<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">v</mi><mrow><mi>r</mi><mi>m</mi><mi>s</mi></mrow></msub><mo>(</mo><mi>dia</mi><mo>)</mo><mo>&#60;</mo><msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">v</mi><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"italic\">r</mi><mi mathvariant=\"italic\">m</mi><mi mathvariant=\"italic\">s</mi></mrow></msub><mo>(</mo><mi>poly</mi><mo>)</mo><mo>&#60;</mo><msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">v</mi><mrow><mi>r</mi><mi>m</mi><mi>s</mi></mrow></msub><mo>(</mo><mi>mono</mi><mo>)</mo></math>",
